{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39230","headline":"自孟津舟西上雨中作 · 韦庄","name":"自孟津舟西上雨中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋烟漠漠与蒙蒙，不卷征帆任晚风。\n百口寄安沧海上，一身逃难绿林中。\n来时楚岸杨花白，去日隋堤蓼穗红。\n却到故园翻似客，归心迢递秣陵东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}